  "body": "Current WebHID spec expects Usage Page appears once per HIDCollectionInfo, but there is no such restriction in the USB HID spec AFAIK. Usage Page is just a Global Item like other global ones such as Logical Minimum, etc. These field appear per HIDReportItem, and Usage Page should be so too.\r\n\r\nHID1_11.pdf, Device Class Definition for Human Interface Devices (HID) Firmware Specification Version 1.11, P.25 shows an example report that contains the case.",
